        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Wow could say so much about  My first time experience with Heather i’m so thrilled and so satisfied with my results!\nI got an eyelash lift and tint! I’ve tried other places in the past and I found that it was never working\nthey kept saying my lashes are too short or they don’t take..\nthey won’t bend?\nbut I must say that Heathers formula was magical!! 🥰\nAfter listening to my concerns and showing me her products and how great it was and her results from her other clients I was convinced , and She was determined to give me my dream lashes with what I already have.\nand did everything she could to make sure that these lashes turned out fantastic! So sweet and so professional from the beginning of my treatment to the end she was so caring and made sure I was comfortable and everything was great! So entertaining like we were already friends or that kind of service!\nI will never go anywhere else. So if you are  thinking of getting any services from Heather as I look forward to trying her other services out some day soon\nI HIGHLY recommend her!\nNO DOUBT you’ll have a great experience!\nI feel I made a new friend in 1hr 1.2!! 😁\nThanks soooo much HEATHER YOUR A GEM!\nLook forward to seeing you again soon\nSincerely Tammy.",
